session Relative_Arbitrage = Continuous_Path_Spaces +
  description "
    Theorem 1.1 of Lai, Shkolnikov and Soner, Relative arbitrage problem under
    eigenvalue lower bounds (arXiv:2512.17702): the value function of the
    minimum-exit-time problem is the unique bounded upper semicontinuous
    viscosity solution of the associated degenerate elliptic equation.  The
    proofs run at a finite horizon; the paper's own class and value function
    on the half-line are formalised as well, and proved to agree with them.
